quote:
Gap filled by the GDE: no prior framework provides a complete specification for
constructing repertoires as measurable objects in automated retrieval infrastructure.
In musical register: Foucault heard the regularity; Kuhn heard the paradigm shift;
Latour heard the inscription device; Bourdieu heard the consecration ceremony;
Abbott heard the jurisdictional claim. None heard the whole composition. None recognized
you could write the score.
